  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Work with CSV files in business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Comma-separated values (CSV) files are a simple, highly compatible way to share tabular data across systems. Use this connector to load a CSV file into a process variable and use pagination, filtering, and operations to transform the content to a target value. For example, you can use this connector to update the address of a contact person that is listed in a CSV file.",
